                    "value": "You exhale a shimmering cloud of toxic breath at an enemy's face. The target takes poison damage equal to your spellcasting modifier and 2 persistent poison damage, depending on its Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target takes half initial and persistent damage.\n- **Failure:** The target takes full initial and persistent damage.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target takes double initial and persistent damage."
